# Components

Major Svelte UI under `src/lib/components/`. Prefer extending these over new parallel shells.

## Lesson chrome

| Component | Use when |
|-----------|----------|
| `LessonSectionNav.svelte` | Sticky sub-nav: Read · Topic lab · Simulate · Practice · Solutions |
| `LessonCodeSnippet.svelte` | Read-only code in lesson body |
| `MermaidDiagram.svelte` | Mermaid in topic labs |

## Interactive / study

| Component | Use when |
|-----------|----------|
| `LessonExplorer.svelte` | Topic lab (`lesson.interactive` / `interactiveLessons.js`) |
| `AiLessonStudyGuide.svelte` | AI-flow topic lab (`#topic-lab`) |
| `LessonSolutionPanel.svelte` | Enhanced case-study solutions (`solutionLoader.js`) |

## IDE / practice shells

| Component | Use when |
|-----------|----------|
| `IDEWorkspace.svelte` | VS Code–like explorer + Monaco + bottom panels; IndexedDB FS |
| `CodeEditor.svelte` | Monaco wrapper (multi-file, snippets, palette) |
| `PracticeIDE.svelte` | Markdown 3-step mock answers + LLM panel (HLD/LLD/AI) |
| `DsaPracticeIDE.svelte` | Curated DSA highlights, languages, WASM tests, timer |
| `QuestionBankIDE.svelte` | Lazy JSON banks + same WASM stack |
| `MLPracticeIDE.svelte` | AI ML scripts via `static/ml-py-worker.js` |
| `SimulationIDE.svelte` | Topology editor + run engine (HLD) |
| `TopologyBuilder.svelte` | Visual topology; syncs with `.flow` DSL |

## App chrome / assistant

| Component | Use when |
|-----------|----------|
| `ProgressControls.svelte` | Export/import backup, reset progress |
| `LlmAssistantPanel.svelte` | Provider settings + completions (embedded in Practice IDE) |

## Orphans (exist, not routed)

`SimulationLab.svelte`, `PracticeWorkspace.svelte` — do not wire new flows through these without cleaning up; prefer `SimulationIDE` / `PracticeIDE`.

## UI rule of thumb

Plain markup + `app.css` classes first. Scoped CSS OK for IDE chrome; keep the shared dark palette.
